---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="About">
  <section class="page-intro container">
    <span class="eyebrow">ABOUT THE STUDIO</span>
    <h1 class="reveal">
      Independent by design.
      <br />
      <em>Curious by nature.</em>
    </h1>
    <p class="reveal reveal-delay-2">
      Side Quest Studios is an independent game development studio exploring the
      intersection of art, technology, and storytelling.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="section container two-col reveal reveal-delay-3">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">WHY WE BUILD</span>
      <h2>The interesting stuff happens off the main path.</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>
        We believe the best game worlds invite players to look closer. Every
        strange machine, forgotten corridor, and unexpected interaction is an
        opportunity to tell a story.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our work spans environment art, material design, 3D modeling, Blueprint
        programming, and the countless experiments that make a game feel alive.
      </p>
      <p>
        The development blog shares that process openly, from early blockouts to
        the small technical victories that make everything click.
      </p>
      <div class="tool-list">
        <span>UNREAL ENGINE 5</span>
        <span>MAYA</span>
        <span>ZBRUSH</span>
        <span>SUBSTANCE 3D PAINTER</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
